"Comment l'IA détermine le Débit et le Crédit grâce au profil de votre "
"entreprise"

msgid ""
"When processing scanned paperwork or receipts, the AI agent compares the "
"document against your company's name and tax identifiers to eliminate "
"accounting ambiguity:"
