"Classé comme <strong>Facture fournisseur (À payer)</strong>. Écriture : "
"<strong>Débit</strong> = Charges/Stock, <strong>Crédit</strong> = Dettes "
"fournisseurs."

msgid "Our Company is the Seller (Billed From)"
msgstr "Notre entreprise est le vendeur (Facturé par)"

msgid ""
"Classified as <strong>Customer Invoice (Receivable)</strong>. Ledger effect:"
